      "id": "edge-class-ports",
      "type": "page-section",
      "label": "Ports and Relationships",
      "position": {
        "x": 1290,
        "y": -250
      },
      "width": 720,
      "height": 380,
      "data": {
        "title": "Ports and Relationships",
        "body": "The class constrains relationship endpoints by semantic kinds and cardinality. A `surface` edge connects a root to its first face; `next-face` connects a face to the next face or to the terminal Glyph.",
