      "data": {
        "title": "Where this lives",
        "body": "Source (twilite repository):\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/edgeClass.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/edgeClassRegistry.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/edgeLegality.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/portCapacity.js`\n\nFocused tests (twilite repository):\n- `tests/coreEdgeClasses.test.js`\n- `tests/edgeLegality.test.js`\n- `tests/portCapacity.test.js`\n\nThese pointers identify evidence to inspect. Structural validation does not prove runtime or browser behavior.",
